<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Ansible on Azure — Container workload</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Red+Hat+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Red+Hat+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #151515;
      --muted: #5c5c5c;
      --paper: #faf7f2;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --accent: #ee0000;
      --accent-soft: #ffe6e6;
      --azure: #0078d4;
      --border: #e8e4dc;
      --radius: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(21, 21, 21, 0.08);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Red Hat Text", system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% -10%, #ffe8e8 0%, transparent 55%),
                  radial-gradient(900px 500px at 100% 0%, #e6f2ff 0%, transparent 50%),
                  var(--paper);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .wrap {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3rem;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid #ffc9c9;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: "Red Hat Display", system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 36em;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }
    .hero-card p {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .hero-card strong { color: var(--ink); }
    .hostname {
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", monospace;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      background: #f4f1eb;
      border: 1px dashed var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
      word-break: break-all;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: "Red Hat Display", system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    h2 span.dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--azure);
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 560px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    .res {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }
    .res label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .res code {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      word-break: break-all;
      color: #0d47a1;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--azure); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .arch-map-note {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
      max-width: 42em;
    }
    .arch-svg-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fafafa 0%, #fff 40%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.5rem 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    }
    .arch-svg-wrap svg {
      display: block;
      width: min(100%, 720px);
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .arch-legend {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    @keyframes arch-flow-shift {
      to { stroke-dashoffset: -40; }
    }
    .arch-flow-line {
      stroke-dasharray: 10 8;
      animation: arch-flow-shift 1.05s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes arch-dash-drift {
      to { stroke-dashoffset: -22; }
    }
    .arch-dash-flow {
      animation: arch-dash-drift 2.8s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes arch-bulb-pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; fill: #00bcf2; }
      50% { opacity: 0.2; fill: #0078d4; }
    }
    .arch-endpoint-bulb {
      animation: arch-bulb-pulse 1.65s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes arch-app-soft {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.55; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }
    .arch-app-glow {
      animation: arch-app-soft 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .arch-flow-line,
      .arch-dash-flow,
      .arch-endpoint-bulb,
      .arch-app-glow {
        animation: none !important;
      }
      .arch-flow-line {
        stroke-dasharray: unset;
        stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="badge">Sample workload</div>
      <h1>Deployed by Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform on Azure</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This page runs inside <strong>Azure Container Apps</strong>. Use it to confirm ingress and,
        after playbook 04, traffic through <strong>Azure Front Door (Standard)</strong>.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-card">
      <p>
        You reached this page on host
        <strong id="via-host">…</strong>
        <noscript>(enable JavaScript to see the hostname.)</noscript>
      </p>
      <div class="hostname" id="via-host-full" hidden></div>
      <script>
        (function () {
          var h = location.hostname || "(unknown)";
          var el = document.getElementById("via-host");
          if (el) el.textContent = h;
          var box = document.getElementById("via-host-full");
          if (box) { box.textContent = location.href; box.hidden = false; }
        })();
      </script>
    </section>

    <section class="hero-card">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Architecture map (schematic)</h2>
      <p class="arch-map-note">
        Solid arrows show the <strong>request path</strong> users follow when Front Door is enabled.
        Dashed lines are <strong>not live app dependencies</strong> for this sample HTML—they only show resources
        Ansible provisioned together in the same demo stack (your real app would wire SQL, storage, etc. as you design).
      </p>
      <div class="arch-svg-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="archTitle archDesc" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <title id="archTitle">Azure demo workload traffic and resources</title>
          <desc id="archDesc">
            Clients connect over HTTPS to Azure Front Door Standard, which forwards to an Azure Container Apps workload.
            Azure Container Registry, Azure SQL, and a storage account are shown as related platform resources for this demo.
          </desc>
          <defs>
            <marker id="arrowSolid" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="9" refY="3" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z" fill="#0078d4" />
            </marker>
            <marker id="arrowDash" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="2.5" orient="auto">
              <path d="M0,0 L0,5 L7,2.5 z" fill="#8a8580" />
            </marker>
          </defs>

          <!-- Row: traffic path -->
          <rect x="24" y="42" width="100" height="52" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#c4bfb6" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <text x="74" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">Clients</text>
          <text x="74" y="82" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#5c5c5c">HTTPS</text>

          <line class="arch-flow-line" x1="128" y1="68" x2="168" y2="68" stroke="#0078d4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowSolid)" />

          <rect x="172" y="28" width="168" height="80" rx="12" fill="#e8f4fc" stroke="#0078d4" stroke-width="1.75" />
          <!-- Pulsing endpoint indicator on the Front Door edge (global entry) -->
          <circle class="arch-endpoint-bulb" cx="256" cy="36" r="5" fill="#0078d4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" aria-hidden="true" />
          <text x="256" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Display, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#004578">Azure Front Door</text>
          <text x="256" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#004578">Standard · global edge</text>
          <text x="256" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#5c5c5c">Profile: {{ aca_frontdoor_profile_name | e }}</text>

          <line class="arch-flow-line" x1="342" y1="68" x2="388" y2="68" stroke="#0078d4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowSolid)" />

          <rect x="392" y="28" width="200" height="80" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#ee0000" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <!-- Soft pulse on compute box (ingress target) -->
          <circle class="arch-app-glow" cx="492" cy="36" r="4" fill="#ee0000" opacity="0.45" aria-hidden="true" />
          <text x="492" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Display, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">Container Apps</text>
          <text x="492" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#5c5c5c">This page runs here</text>
          <text x="492" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#0d47a1">{{ aca_container_app_name | e }}</text>

          <!-- Dashed: platform footprint (not app data flow for this sample) -->
          <text x="360" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#8a8580" letter-spacing="0.04em">SAME DEMO STACK (PROVISIONED BY ANSIBLE)</text>

          <path class="arch-dash-flow" d="M 492 110 L 492 150 L 118 150 L 118 168" fill="none" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5" marker-end="url(#arrowDash)" />
          <path class="arch-dash-flow" d="M 492 110 L 492 150 L 288 150 L 288 168" fill="none" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5" marker-end="url(#arrowDash)" />
          <path class="arch-dash-flow" d="M 492 110 L 492 150 L 458 150 L 458 168" fill="none" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5" marker-end="url(#arrowDash)" />

          <rect x="58" y="170" width="120" height="56" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
          <text x="118" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">ACR</text>
          <text x="118" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" fill="#5c5c5c">Container images</text>

          <rect x="228" y="170" width="120" height="56" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
          <text x="288" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">Azure SQL</text>
          <text x="288" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" fill="#5c5c5c">Database (demo)</text>

          <rect x="398" y="170" width="120" height="56" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
          <text x="458" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">Storage</text>
          <text x="458" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" fill="#5c5c5c">Account (demo)</text>

          <rect x="538" y="170" width="158" height="56" rx="10" fill="#fff" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
          <text x="617" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">Log Analytics</text>
          <text x="617" y="212" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" fill="#5c5c5c">ACA observability</text>

          <path class="arch-dash-flow" d="M 492 110 L 492 150 L 617 150 L 617 168" fill="none" stroke="#b0aba3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5" marker-end="url(#arrowDash)" />

          <text x="360" y="268" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Red Hat Text, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" fill="#5c5c5c">Resource group <tspan font-weight="600" fill="#0d47a1">{{ container_workload_resource_group_name | e }}</tspan> · {{ container_workload_region | e }}</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="arch-legend">Diagram is illustrative; exact routing and private endpoints depend on your production design. Motion pauses when the browser requests reduced motion.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="hero-card">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Related Azure resources (this demo)</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="res">
          <label>Resource group</label>
          <code>{{ container_workload_resource_group_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Region</label>
          <code>{{ container_workload_region | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Azure Container Registry</label>
          <code>{{ aca_acr_name | e }}.azurecr.io</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Azure SQL server</label>
          <code>{{ aca_sql_server_name | e }}.database.windows.net</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Azure SQL database</label>
          <code>{{ aca_sql_database_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Storage account</label>
          <code>{{ aca_storage_account_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Log Analytics workspace</label>
          <code>{{ aca_log_analytics_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Container Apps environment</label>
          <code>{{ aca_container_apps_env_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Container App</label>
          <code>{{ aca_container_app_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
        <div class="res">
          <label>Azure Front Door profile</label>
          <code>{{ aca_frontdoor_profile_name | e }}</code>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform · Microsoft Azure · Container Apps sample
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
